**How it works:**
- `reading-group-join@local.edu` → LMTP → Mailman creates a pending join request
- `reading-group-leave@local.edu` → LMTP → Mailman creates a pending leave request  
- `reading-group@local.edu` → LMTP → Mailman distributes to all subscribers
- Confirmation emails go to `reading-group-confirm+<hash>@local.edu`
